---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Lee Hart - Privacy Policy">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>
    This site uses Google Analytics to understand how visitors use it —
    for example, which pages are viewed and roughly how much traffic the
    site receives. This only happens if you accept the cookie banner
    shown on your first visit. If you decline, no analytics cookies are
    set and no data is sent to Google Analytics.
  </p>
  <p>
    You can change your choice at any time by clearing your browser's
    cookies/site data for this domain and reloading the page, which will
    show the banner again.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact form</h2>
  <p>
    If you use the contact form, the information you submit (name, email
    address, and message) is stored securely and used only to respond to
    your enquiry. It is not shared with third parties or used for
    marketing.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about this policy can be sent to
    {' '}<a href="mailto:lee@hartsoft.dev">lee@hartsoft.dev</a>.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>